AvaloniaWeb 0.2.0-alpha.1

An independent, partial JavaScript reimplementation of Avalonia APIs and a
XamlX-style compiler architecture. This is not an official AvaloniaUI,
XamlX, Skia, or ReactiveUI release. Product names identify compatibility
references; no affiliation or endorsement is claimed.

Reference: AvaloniaUI/Avalonia, copyright AvaloniaUI OÜ (MIT).
Reference: kekekeks/XamlX, copyright 2019 Nikita Tsukanov (MIT).
Reference license texts are retained in licenses/.
Full upstream Git repositories are not bundled. docs/upstream-lock.json
records the inspected source revisions. scripts/sync-upstream.mjs obtains
full source clones on a networked development machine; this download step
was not executed in the delivery environment.

The native renderer is the actual SkiaSharpWeb distribution from
wieslawsoltes/SkiaSharpWeb. Its third-party notices and native build metadata
remain under vendor/skiasharpweb/dist/. Skia, CanvasKit, font engines and
other embedded dependencies retain their upstream licenses.

ReactiveWeb and its RxJS implementation are actual upstream browser
bundles, not replacements. Retain vendor/licenses/ and the browser chunks.
RxJS is Apache-2.0 licensed; additional included components have their own
license/notice files. The root MIT license does not relicense these files.

No font files are included. Browser system-font rasterization supplies the
default text path. Native fonts must be explicitly supplied by the host.

See docs/COMPATIBILITY.md before relying on behavioral compatibility.
